OL,3,GNEWSAWatch: Palestine Action factory
OL,4,Abreak-in captured on bodycam
OL,5,
OL,6,FFootage from a body-worn camera shows
OL,7,FPalestine Action supporters breaking
OL,8,Finto a factory associated with an
OL,9,FIsrael-linked defence firm, a court
OL,10,Fheard.
OL,12,FIn a video played before a jury at the
OL,13,FOld Bailey, activists in red boiler
OL,14,Fsuits can be heard swearing as they are
OL,15,Fconfronted by two security guards.
OL,17,FOne of the guards, Billy Dennis, told
OL,18,Fthe court on Monday intruders smashed
OL,19,Fthe windows of a Land Rover and that he
OL,20,Fwas "struck in the face" during the
OL,21,Fearly morning raid on Instro Precision
OL,22,Fin Sandwich, Kent, on 17 June, 2024.
OL,23,APub: 13-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
